Anumaan
Fresh code written in September 2026 for Build with AI: Code for Communities, Second
Edition (Google Cloud x GDG India, Track 03). No code was reused from earlier projects.

All patient, dispensing, stock, bed, staff and warehouse data in this repository and in
the live demo is SYNTHETIC, generated by anumaan/sim.py and anumaan/care.py. The one
exception is anumaan/realcheck_england.json (see "Real data" below).

Third-party software (runtime)
  NumPy                   BSD-3-Clause (and bundled MIT, Zlib, 0BSD, CC0-1.0 parts)
  Google OR-Tools         Apache-2.0
  FastAPI                 MIT
  Uvicorn                 BSD-3-Clause
  Pydantic                MIT
  Google Gen AI SDK       Apache-2.0
  google-auth             Apache-2.0
  HTTPX                   BSD-3-Clause
  Requests                Apache-2.0
